  "loops": [
    {
      "id": "sere",
      "label": "SERE — self-enhancing loop",
      "blurb": "The estate improving itself: a model proposes a change, code alone judges it against the gate set, and only a pass may land — merge, converge, and rescan happen outside this engine. Doctrine: files/anatomy/bone/ledger.py."
    },
    {
      "id": "news-scout",
      "label": "news-scout — feed scouting + consolidation",
      "blurb": "On a daily cadence, fetch the declared external feeds, extract and dedup, then consolidate the signal into the KEAP corpus and hand the operator a digest. The consolidation is the point — raw fetch is easy; corpus-linked knowledge is the loop. GDPR/EU-residency applies to anything stored."
    },
    {
      "id": "repo-check",
      "label": "repo-check — red / estate / forge, report only",
      "blurb": "On a four-hour cadence, read what is red, what the three holders of truth disagree on, and whether the forges would fast-forward. Nothing is applied. The overnight sample is the pulse run log, not a success stamp this loop writes about itself."
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-bench",
      "label": "vision-bench — invoice extraction accuracy vs the rendered ground truth",
      "blurb": "Daily, run the vision pipeline over the consulting-firm fixture images and score each extracted field against what the image was rendered from (state/fixtures/consulting-firm/*.image.txt), plus the ISDOC cross-check control. Reports per-field accuracy and per-doc spread; a score below floor is a finding, not a crash. Prerequisites, or it reports it cannot run: run tools/gen-invoice-images.py once to render the images, and have qwen2.5vl:7b pulled + ollama armed."
    }
  ],
